# The id belongs here rather than in an overlay's unconditional block.  It was
# set unconditionally in two overlays at once, work included second, so work
# won and EVERY personal repo reported the work id.  The address was being
# scoped carefully at the time and said nothing about it, which is why the two
# now travel together.
